      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/n/f04885/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2017-05-29T09:03:12.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Xtreme Haka actually will be the best single power to combo with Chronoranger, or with Setback with High Risk Behavior x2 and a Looking Up. He'll also make Tempest's Localized Hurricane easy to keep out, or Cosmic's Unflagging Animation basically free. I'm looking forward to that one the most.</p><p>Xtreme Argent Adept's Rebel Yell also looks like a blast, it'll combo well with Xtreme Haka and should let him regain 2hp when damaged.</p>",
