      "raw": "<p>Xtreme Haka actually will be the best single power to combo with Chronoranger, or with Setback with High Risk Behavior x2 and a Looking Up. He&#39;ll also make Tempest&#39;s Localized Hurricane easy to keep out, or Cosmic&#39;s Unflagging Animation basically free. I&#39;m looking forward to that one the most.</p><p>Xtreme Argent Adept&#39;s Rebel Yell also looks like a blast, it&#39;ll combo well with Xtreme Haka and should let him regain 2hp when damaged.</p>",
